{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます..* ろってぃ−です.♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/01/1216050/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から３日間キャンペーンと言うことで\nまいやん ななせ ろってぃ−の３人で大阪に来ています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関西のラジオ、TV番組、取材...等々、色んなお仕事してきます.*\n８枚目シングル『気づいたら片想い』もしっかりアピールしてきますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/01/1216050/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願い致します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまいやんは、べちょべちょのたこ焼が好きです。\nまひろも おっきなべちょべちょたこ焼が好きです。\nななせも ソースマヨ大好きです.*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/01/1216050/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は あべのキューズモールよろちくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/01/1216050/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}